{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-deet-science2-29","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":29,"points":null,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"E)","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_rxn"],"stem":"아밀로오스(amylose)를구성하고있는글루코오스의단위수와\n몰질량을구하고자한다. 아밀로오스를메틸화시킨후가수분해\n하면4-위치에하이드록시기(－OH)가있는글루코오스만이\n2,3,4,6-tetra-O-methyl-D-glucose (A)로\n전환되고\n나머지\n글루코오스는모두2,3,6-tri-O-methyl-D-glucose로전환된다.\nH\nCH2OH\nH\nO\nHO\nH\nHO\nH\nCH2OH\nH\nH\nOH\nO\nH\nO\nH\nHO\nH\nCH2OH\nH\nH\nOH\nO\nH\nO\nH\nn\nHO\n아밀로오스\nH\nOH\nH\nOH\n아밀로오스430 mg을사용하여위의과정을수행하였더니화합물\nA가5.3 μ mol이생성되었고, 이것의몰백분율은0.20%이었다.\n이아밀로오스의글루코오스단위수와몰질량을바르게짝지은\n것은?\n글루코오스단위수(개)\n아밀로오스몰질량(g/mol)","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040","t041","t042","t043","t044","t045","t046"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"5.0×102 8.1×104","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t047","t048","t049"]},{"number":2,"text":"5.0×102 4.0×104","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t050","t051","t052"]},{"number":3,"text":"2.5×102 8.1×104","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t053","t054","t055"]},{"number":4,"text":"2.5×102 4.0×104","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t056","t057","t058"]},{"number":5,"text":"1.0×102 2.0×104","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t059","t060","t061"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":617,"height":260,"region":0,"bbox":[37.75,113.731,246.8,104.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-